WEBVTT

00:00:12.940 --> 00:00:20.040
Rental Magica

00:01:43.400 --> 00:01:46.970
Having gone to the home of the Katsuragi
family to meet up with Mikan and Nekoyashiki,

00:01:46.970 --> 00:01:50.540
Honami and I accepted a
contract to exterminate an oni...

00:01:50.540 --> 00:01:53.910
...as a condition for their
allowing Mikan to return to Astral.

00:01:55.240 --> 00:01:56.610
In pursuit of the actual oni,

00:01:56.610 --> 00:02:01.620
we came to Ikazuchi Hill where we
found Nekoyashiki, who'd gone missing,

00:02:01.620 --> 00:02:04.310
along with Mikan's older sister Kaori.

00:02:06.720 --> 00:02:10.790
Kaori told us that the Katsuragi ritual
involved creating and then devouring an oni,

00:02:10.790 --> 00:02:15.920
and that Mikan had been called back
to act as a human sacrifice for it.

00:02:17.170 --> 00:02:20.770
Kaori had asked Nekoyashiki to
hide her from the Katsuragis...

00:02:20.770 --> 00:02:24.070
...in order to stop them from sacrificing Mikan.

00:02:25.310 --> 00:02:31.310
However, their grandmother Suzuka,
the matriarch of the Katsuragi family,

00:02:31.310 --> 00:02:33.680
managed to track our location...

00:02:34.120 --> 00:02:37.480
And now the ritual has begun!

00:02:42.890 --> 00:02:45.090
The ritual begins.

00:02:50.970 --> 00:02:53.800
Episode 20
THE ONI RITUAL

00:02:57.640 --> 00:02:58.730
Mikan...

00:03:01.540 --> 00:03:04.210
Coming! Who's there?

00:03:06.050 --> 00:03:09.820
Let not evil doings of evil days pollute you,

00:03:09.820 --> 00:03:12.950
do not go astray upon the roads to the side,

00:03:12.950 --> 00:03:15.550
speak not and be in harmony...

00:03:16.460 --> 00:03:17.320
The barrier!

00:03:18.490 --> 00:03:20.860
Kan gon shin son ri kon da ken!

00:03:26.430 --> 00:03:27.200
Look!

00:03:28.040 --> 00:03:31.300
Look! Look! Look!

00:03:31.540 --> 00:03:33.630
Behold the true spell!

00:03:40.220 --> 00:03:40.980
Run!

00:03:43.950 --> 00:03:44.710
Kaori!
Kaori!

00:03:52.160 --> 00:03:53.420
It's finally manifested!

00:03:53.660 --> 00:03:55.250
That's the oni?!

00:03:58.700 --> 00:03:59.560
Kaori!

00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:02.600
Hail! Horned Fauni of the forest!

00:04:06.440 --> 00:04:07.500
Kaori!

00:04:07.740 --> 00:04:08.670
Tatsumi!

00:04:11.550 --> 00:04:13.240
Tatsumi!

00:04:13.850 --> 00:04:15.410
Kaori!

00:04:15.880 --> 00:04:17.650
Horned god Cernunnos!

00:04:23.630 --> 00:04:26.920
The ritual has begun?

00:04:33.400 --> 00:04:34.390
It disappeared.

00:04:36.200 --> 00:04:38.140
Looks like we've been played for fools.

00:04:38.410 --> 00:04:42.740
She foresaw that the president would
make contact with you and set a trap.

00:04:43.480 --> 00:04:44.970
If I had just noticed...

00:04:45.610 --> 00:04:49.520
If you'd noticed, then she would
have used some other method.

00:04:49.950 --> 00:04:53.480
Our opponent is the cunning
head of the Katsuragi family.

00:04:53.550 --> 00:04:54.280
Dammit!

00:04:54.460 --> 00:04:56.120
Once again, I couldn't protect her!

00:04:58.330 --> 00:04:59.350
Stop, please!

00:05:02.060 --> 00:05:03.890
What good will that do?!

00:05:04.100 --> 00:05:06.370
Shut up! What do you know?!

00:05:06.370 --> 00:05:07.130
I understand!

00:05:07.740 --> 00:05:08.720
I understand...

00:05:09.270 --> 00:05:11.970
Mikan was taken from me, too...

00:05:12.910 --> 00:05:15.600
We'll all go home together, right?

00:05:16.740 --> 00:05:20.110
Mikan was trying her best
to keep the truth from me.

00:05:23.350 --> 00:05:26.680
That's why I have a job to do now!

00:05:27.920 --> 00:05:29.820
Help me to do it, Tatsumi!

00:05:32.660 --> 00:05:35.990
Let's go and take back Mikan and Kaori!

00:05:39.230 --> 00:05:40.060
Thank you...

00:05:54.180 --> 00:05:55.810
It was three years ago...

00:05:57.050 --> 00:05:57.980
I told you already.

00:05:58.250 --> 00:06:00.120
That I was called back here...

00:06:00.990 --> 00:06:02.220
Three years ago...

00:06:02.220 --> 00:06:04.190
The last time the Katsuragi ritual was performed?

00:06:04.660 --> 00:06:05.420
Yeah.

00:06:11.170 --> 00:06:13.500
Let not evil doings of evil days pollute you,

00:06:13.500 --> 00:06:15.540
do not go astray upon the roads to the side,

00:06:15.540 --> 00:06:17.070
speak not and be in harmony,

00:06:17.070 --> 00:06:19.470
step not falsely on the
path of the jeweled halberd...

00:06:19.770 --> 00:06:22.800
With this, the next generation of
the Katsuragi family will be secure.

00:06:24.880 --> 00:06:26.210
K-Kaori?!

00:06:26.510 --> 00:06:28.240
I said you mustn't come here!

00:06:29.420 --> 00:06:30.320
Mother?

00:06:30.750 --> 00:06:31.380
Kaori?

00:06:36.060 --> 00:06:37.890
Concentrate on the ritual!

00:06:38.190 --> 00:06:43.490
Majestic soul, revered unto the high
heavens as the great god of the Katsuragi,

00:06:43.770 --> 00:06:50.760
by the words of the god of Takagi in Chihaya,
evil spirit who deals every sort of curse...

00:07:08.560 --> 00:07:10.220
Mother!

00:07:13.130 --> 00:07:16.620
The ritual failed and the oni disappeared.

00:07:17.530 --> 00:07:19.030
I was punished because,

00:07:19.030 --> 00:07:22.330
as a guardian, I did not protect
either Kaori or her mother.

00:07:23.270 --> 00:07:25.670
That's why I have to protect
Kaori and Mikan now.

00:07:26.210 --> 00:07:28.330
Because I am a guardian of the Katsuragi.

00:07:34.150 --> 00:07:36.780
Mirror of the true and serene soul,

00:07:36.780 --> 00:07:41.240
shine and illuminate us...

00:07:41.620 --> 00:07:42.420
It comes!

00:07:50.530 --> 00:07:53.090
The ritual has begun?

00:07:55.040 --> 00:07:56.400
M-Miss Kaori!

00:08:06.380 --> 00:08:09.610
It's common to attach impurity
and malice to another person...

00:08:09.680 --> 00:08:10.580
Disregard her!

00:08:15.560 --> 00:08:20.120
The ritual has begun?

00:08:23.230 --> 00:08:25.670
Oni binding, a Katsuragi spell.

00:08:25.670 --> 00:08:27.430
It cannot escape.

00:08:27.700 --> 00:08:29.000
Smash its horns!

00:08:29.000 --> 00:08:33.770
God who shines with firefly light...

00:08:37.480 --> 00:08:38.950
M... Miss Kaori!

00:08:39.150 --> 00:08:40.610
It doesn't matter! Continue!

00:08:41.820 --> 00:08:44.720
As there are the words that call for
the rebirth of the plants and trees...

00:08:44.720 --> 00:08:46.320
Smash it!
As there are the words that call for
the rebirth of the plants and trees...

00:08:46.320 --> 00:08:50.720
As there are the words that call for
the rebirth of the plants and trees...

00:08:51.030 --> 00:08:52.960
At this rate, Miss Kaori will be killed!

00:08:54.400 --> 00:08:55.260
Stop!

00:09:00.130 --> 00:09:01.340
We've no choice.

00:09:01.340 --> 00:09:02.890
We'll just have to force it as it is.

00:09:11.850 --> 00:09:14.370
We're not climbing up there that easily.

00:09:19.120 --> 00:09:22.420
It's almost sounds as if... it's weeping.

00:09:22.590 --> 00:09:24.820
Perhaps the oni has fallen
to the Katsuragi family.

00:09:25.030 --> 00:09:27.460
Has the ritual entered its final stage?

00:09:27.800 --> 00:09:29.130
Final stage?

00:09:30.060 --> 00:09:32.120
The oni will be transferred into Mikan.

00:09:32.430 --> 00:09:35.130
Within her body, the oni will be purified.

00:09:35.370 --> 00:09:38.810
And then, at the very end, it will
be ripped back out of her body.

00:09:39.040 --> 00:09:41.170
What happens to Mikan when they do that?

00:09:41.410 --> 00:09:44.140
It will be violent for her, like an amputation.

00:09:44.680 --> 00:09:46.510
She may lose her life in the process.

00:09:46.950 --> 00:09:47.920
N-No!

00:09:49.020 --> 00:09:49.740
Hurry!

00:09:57.730 --> 00:09:58.780
Big Sister?

00:09:59.830 --> 00:10:01.350
Mikan, is that you?

00:10:02.260 --> 00:10:06.170
I thought that I could keep the
festival from starting if I hid.

00:10:06.500 --> 00:10:07.260
I'm sorry.

00:10:07.800 --> 00:10:09.600
It's not your fault, Big Sister.

00:10:09.670 --> 00:10:11.660
Even so, I'm sorry.

00:10:13.240 --> 00:10:15.440
Three years ago, mother died.

00:10:16.610 --> 00:10:19.480
If I hadn't sneaked into the ritual then,

00:10:19.480 --> 00:10:21.950
you wouldn't be in this predicament.

00:10:23.050 --> 00:10:26.040
It's my fault that you have to
be the human sacrifice for this.

00:10:26.320 --> 00:10:28.550
I don't mind, really!

00:10:28.820 --> 00:10:29.520
Mikan?

00:10:29.760 --> 00:10:34.320
For the first time, I can serve
some purpose as your substitute.

00:10:34.660 --> 00:10:36.290
You call yourself a "substitute"?

00:10:37.830 --> 00:10:39.160
You're nothing of the sort!

00:10:39.430 --> 00:10:40.300
Sister...

00:10:43.240 --> 00:10:46.700
Now begins the rite of human sacrifice!

00:10:47.310 --> 00:10:49.610
I'm glad I could speak to
you one last time, Big Sister.

00:10:51.710 --> 00:10:52.580
Big Sister?

00:10:52.810 --> 00:10:55.370
The ritual is beginning?

00:10:56.150 --> 00:10:57.340
Don't go...

00:10:57.990 --> 00:11:00.680
Don't... harm... my little sister!

00:11:07.660 --> 00:11:08.590
Big Sister?

00:11:19.440 --> 00:11:20.430
Big Sister!

00:11:35.490 --> 00:11:37.260
The ritual...

00:11:37.260 --> 00:11:41.720
Pillar of Maki, stand stout and true.

00:11:43.060 --> 00:11:44.620
The ritual...

00:11:48.040 --> 00:11:50.270
The ritual... The ritual...

00:11:52.040 --> 00:11:53.300
Now, of all times!

00:12:20.130 --> 00:12:25.440
The ritual is beginning?

00:12:35.550 --> 00:12:38.140
So, we needed to smash both its horns!

00:12:39.120 --> 00:12:41.160
At this rate, even with the human
sacrifice, it's hopeless!

00:12:41.160 --> 00:12:43.320
It will never enter Mikan as a vessel now!

00:12:45.760 --> 00:12:46.560
What the!

00:12:46.830 --> 00:12:49.090
The oni... is eating the other oni?

00:12:49.400 --> 00:12:50.860
What's this miasma I feel?

00:12:51.630 --> 00:12:52.390
Ma'am?!

00:12:52.970 --> 00:12:54.730
The ceremony has fallen apart.

00:12:55.900 --> 00:12:57.460
It will sweep everything away.

00:12:57.740 --> 00:13:00.730
The oni will destroy the
ley line and everything else.

00:13:00.940 --> 00:13:04.140
This land will become uninhabitable!

00:13:06.710 --> 00:13:07.610
Mikan!
Mikan!

00:13:08.350 --> 00:13:09.010
Kaori!

00:13:10.920 --> 00:13:12.610
Maintain the misogi purification!

00:13:12.950 --> 00:13:13.580
Yes, ma'am!

00:13:20.730 --> 00:13:21.630
Let's go!

00:13:27.570 --> 00:13:29.570
You started this ritual,

00:13:29.570 --> 00:13:31.400
and now you're just abandoning
it partway through?!

00:13:31.470 --> 00:13:32.170
Silence!

00:13:32.740 --> 00:13:34.640
Just remember this...

00:13:34.640 --> 00:13:37.010
This land has only been able to live
because the Katsuragi family...

00:13:37.010 --> 00:13:39.070
...took the malice it contained upon themselves!

00:13:39.250 --> 00:13:39.870
But!

00:13:40.110 --> 00:13:41.480
And you're just going to leave that thing behind?!

00:13:41.950 --> 00:13:45.010
Even the power of the Katsuragi
family can do nothing about this.

00:13:45.450 --> 00:13:47.760
We'll just have to go to The Association for help.

00:13:47.760 --> 00:13:50.090
There's no way we can avoid a
terrible punishment from them.

00:13:50.090 --> 00:13:51.080
I!

00:13:51.730 --> 00:13:55.560
I... I'm going to see the ritual through.

00:13:57.330 --> 00:14:00.460
Whether it's malice or an oni,
I can't just ignore it!

00:14:00.770 --> 00:14:02.670
And what can you do?!

00:14:04.910 --> 00:14:07.570
I don't know, but I'll try.

00:14:07.910 --> 00:14:09.010
All right, let's do it!

00:14:09.010 --> 00:14:09.600
Huh?

00:14:10.280 --> 00:14:13.250
You're part of Astral, Mikan,

00:14:13.250 --> 00:14:15.680
so a job for you is a job for all of us!

00:14:17.350 --> 00:14:18.610
Brother Pres!

00:14:19.050 --> 00:14:22.650
Besides, we're still on a bid for the
Katsuragi family as Rental Magica.

00:14:22.760 --> 00:14:25.030
Exactly. We're still on an oni extermination.

00:14:25.030 --> 00:14:27.080
If we don't destroy that thing, we won't get paid.

00:14:27.860 --> 00:14:29.960
We're facing an oni among oni.

00:14:29.960 --> 00:14:33.300
That'll be an A-rank... No, a special A-rank fee!

00:14:35.170 --> 00:14:37.430
If you can do this, I'll pay any price.

00:14:37.770 --> 00:14:39.600
Don't forget you said those words.

00:14:40.010 --> 00:14:41.340
I'll help, too!

00:14:41.810 --> 00:14:42.970
K-Kaori!

00:14:46.380 --> 00:14:47.400
Big Sister!

00:14:47.980 --> 00:14:49.310
Do as you please!

00:14:49.520 --> 00:14:51.750
You will only see how powerless you really are!

00:14:56.290 --> 00:14:58.690
We'll seal the oni in this place.

00:15:00.090 --> 00:15:02.460
You two, protect Kaori and Mikan.

00:15:05.830 --> 00:15:06.630
Big Sister?

00:15:17.440 --> 00:15:19.280
This is the technique to quiet a soul.

00:15:19.650 --> 00:15:21.810
An art only practiced by the Katsuragi masters.

00:15:39.500 --> 00:15:41.870
Work with the eye, Young Master.

00:15:42.740 --> 00:15:44.200
With the eye.

00:15:45.040 --> 00:15:46.630
Don't let it control you.

00:15:47.170 --> 00:15:48.610
Fight together with it.

00:15:52.650 --> 00:15:54.550
Look! Look! Look!

00:15:54.650 --> 00:15:56.140
All right, I'm looking!

00:15:58.850 --> 00:16:00.890
Honami! Right oblique,

00:16:00.890 --> 00:16:02.450
20 degrees, 15 meters forward! Mistletoe!

00:16:02.590 --> 00:16:04.850
Hail! Nansair, goddess of the forest.

00:16:05.330 --> 00:16:07.160
Turn, and then right oblique,

00:16:07.160 --> 00:16:09.030
15 degrees, 22 meters forward! Mistletoe!

00:16:09.030 --> 00:16:10.960
Continue with mistletoe 10 meters forward!

00:16:11.130 --> 00:16:12.500
Beautiful Dione!

00:16:12.670 --> 00:16:14.190
Fauni, gods of the shepherds!

00:16:17.170 --> 00:16:19.110
Right oblique, 45 degrees! Mistletoe!

00:16:19.340 --> 00:16:21.310
Horned god Cernunnos!

00:16:28.580 --> 00:16:32.420
By the cone of power and the
temple of chalk, I beseech you!

00:16:32.650 --> 00:16:34.720
Bind the embers of calamity to the earth!

00:16:34.720 --> 00:16:37.990
Let it be bound in the grasp of
the valley between day and night!

00:16:44.000 --> 00:16:44.590
All right!

00:16:44.830 --> 00:16:46.420
That oni isn't going to get away!

00:16:49.640 --> 00:16:52.330
Purity, emptiness, honesty, righteousness.

00:16:52.670 --> 00:16:57.240
We humbly beseech you to the limits of
heaven to strike and to continue to strike...

00:16:57.810 --> 00:16:58.540
The oni!

00:16:58.780 --> 00:16:59.800
It's disappearing.

00:17:00.250 --> 00:17:02.810
Is this the end of the Katsuragi ritual?

00:17:03.280 --> 00:17:04.310
Almost there!

00:17:11.430 --> 00:17:15.920
Is the ritual not yet finished?!

00:17:16.300 --> 00:17:17.730
It still has that horn.

00:17:17.730 --> 00:17:19.730
The horn is the source of the oni's life.

00:17:19.730 --> 00:17:22.330
As long as it's still there,
it's going to be trouble.

00:17:24.910 --> 00:17:26.340
Useless, as I thought.

00:17:29.310 --> 00:17:30.000
Honami!

00:17:35.120 --> 00:17:36.480
Come forth, Sabnock!

00:17:36.480 --> 00:17:39.710
Able-bodied great marquis
and ruler of the 50 legions!

00:17:51.330 --> 00:17:52.700
Big Sister Adelicia!

00:17:52.970 --> 00:17:54.430
The leader of Goetia?!

00:17:55.970 --> 00:17:56.990
Are you all right?

00:17:58.310 --> 00:17:59.070
Kuroha!

00:17:59.770 --> 00:18:01.330
How's it going, Itsuki?

00:18:02.540 --> 00:18:03.570
Adelicia...

00:18:03.940 --> 00:18:07.640
So, I come back to Japan and
decide to pay Astral a visit...

00:18:07.880 --> 00:18:10.210
Coming! Who's there?

00:18:12.620 --> 00:18:15.250
Is Itsuki in?

00:18:15.390 --> 00:18:16.980
A-Adelicia!

00:18:17.690 --> 00:18:21.060
For heaven's sake, you don't even
give me time to catch a breath.

00:18:24.800 --> 00:18:26.820
Addie, you can tell us about your trip later!

00:18:27.130 --> 00:18:29.030
Right. You don't need to tell me that.

00:18:29.440 --> 00:18:30.160
Mikan!

00:18:30.400 --> 00:18:32.170
Continue the soul quieting!

00:18:33.710 --> 00:18:34.640
Big Sister!

00:18:36.380 --> 00:18:39.400
Purity, emptiness, honesty, righteousness.

00:18:39.910 --> 00:18:45.280
Let evil be blown away like the layered
clouds of heaven by the cleansing wind.

00:18:45.650 --> 00:18:48.180
Grant us that evil be driven from this place.

00:18:48.560 --> 00:18:51.390
Grant us that the light of the spirits
of the dead shines as it should.

00:18:51.390 --> 00:18:53.530
Grant us that the pure spirits of the white jewel...

00:18:53.530 --> 00:18:56.020
...are as straight and true
as the tall bamboo shoots.

00:18:56.160 --> 00:18:58.300
Grant us an auspicious day for a
hard-working and brave heart,

00:18:58.300 --> 00:18:59.330
that evil be driven back like shadows
by the sun of the New Year's dawn.

00:18:59.330 --> 00:19:00.630
The oni's feet...
that evil be driven back like shadows
by the sun of the New Year's dawn.

00:19:00.630 --> 00:19:01.400
that evil be driven back like shadows
by the sun of the New Year's dawn.

00:19:01.570 --> 00:19:02.770
They're disappearing.

00:19:02.770 --> 00:19:08.610
Let the auspicious day be granted all the more...

00:19:10.580 --> 00:19:11.440
Mikan...

00:19:12.510 --> 00:19:13.540
Big Sister.

00:19:17.180 --> 00:19:20.050
In joy and gratitude, eight hands,

00:19:20.050 --> 00:19:21.860
a hundred hands, are raised and cry out!

00:19:21.860 --> 00:19:22.910
Just a bit more!
a hundred hands, are raised and cry out!

00:19:23.220 --> 00:19:26.330
Dance and rise! Dance and withdraw!
Dance and prostrate yourself!

00:19:26.330 --> 00:19:28.230
Worship and revere them!

00:19:43.880 --> 00:19:44.610
It worked!

00:19:52.150 --> 00:19:53.050
Big Sister...

00:19:53.650 --> 00:19:54.280
Mikan...

00:19:59.960 --> 00:20:00.950
Tatsumi!

00:20:02.830 --> 00:20:03.660
Kaori!

00:20:04.430 --> 00:20:07.600
Celtic magic, Onmyoudou, Glam Sight,

00:20:07.600 --> 00:20:09.470
and finally, Mikan's Shinto.

00:20:09.640 --> 00:20:12.540
The combining of different branches of magic.

00:20:12.540 --> 00:20:15.060
So, this is the Astral I've heard about?

00:20:18.580 --> 00:20:22.480
As leader of the Katsuragi family,
I am grateful from the bottom of my heart.

00:20:25.750 --> 00:20:28.620
Mikan, you have fine friends.

00:20:29.720 --> 00:20:30.310
Yes!

00:20:32.430 --> 00:20:34.050
May I ask one thing?

00:20:34.490 --> 00:20:35.430
What?

00:20:35.830 --> 00:20:38.020
Why did you have Mikan be the sacrifice?

00:20:38.230 --> 00:20:41.340
For one thing, it was her duty as
one born to the Katsuragi family.

00:20:41.340 --> 00:20:42.860
There was no choice...

00:20:43.040 --> 00:20:44.700
The other reason...

00:20:44.870 --> 00:20:47.430
...was to exhaust Mikan's magic.

00:20:48.310 --> 00:20:49.430
What do you mean?

00:20:49.880 --> 00:20:52.140
Mikan's talents were too insubstantial.

00:20:52.780 --> 00:20:57.480
So I planned to tear her magic
away from her along with the oni.

00:20:57.780 --> 00:21:00.550
You thought Mikan would be happier that way?

00:21:01.090 --> 00:21:03.780
It would be better to sever
her ties with this world.

00:21:04.590 --> 00:21:05.650
I think you're wrong.

00:21:05.830 --> 00:21:06.620
Wrong?

00:21:08.430 --> 00:21:09.050
Yeah.

00:21:09.760 --> 00:21:14.260
I think it's wrong for you to decide
Mikan's life without asking her.

00:21:15.500 --> 00:21:16.490
Grandma...

00:21:17.800 --> 00:21:18.740
I...

00:21:20.610 --> 00:21:22.940
I'll decide my life by myself.

00:21:23.210 --> 00:21:25.700
That's why I'm going back to Astral.

00:21:26.780 --> 00:21:27.680
With everybody!

00:21:29.820 --> 00:21:30.870
I see.

00:21:34.590 --> 00:21:36.420
Let's go, Brother Pres!

00:21:37.390 --> 00:21:38.380
Master Iba...

00:21:39.660 --> 00:21:43.260
Take good care of Mikan.

00:21:43.900 --> 00:21:44.660
Of course.

00:21:45.130 --> 00:21:47.260
She's one of my precious friends.

00:21:58.210 --> 00:22:07.880
Over and over, holding my wounded hand...
Kizutsuku te wo nandomo tsunaide

00:22:08.290 --> 00:22:16.290
...you walk this uncertain path with me...
fuan bakari no kono michi wo aruite

00:22:17.560 --> 00:22:29.340
...amidst the days as they slowly drift by.
yukkuri nagareta hibi no naka de bokura ga

00:22:29.610 --> 00:22:41.250
The things we obtain are so warm, so beloved.
Te ni shita mono wa konna ni atatakute itoshinda

00:22:41.250 --> 00:22:47.520
Please, as time goes by, let's keep right on...
Nee konomama toki no naka

00:22:47.590 --> 00:22:52.030
...laughing and walking together.
waratte aruite yukou

00:22:52.900 --> 00:22:56.300
It's because you're with me...
Kimi ga iru kara

00:22:56.300 --> 00:23:01.400
...that I can keep moving forward.
mae ni susumerunda

00:23:02.340 --> 00:23:13.280
Now our feelings are becoming one...
Ima bokura no omoi ga hitotsu ni natte

00:23:13.590 --> 00:23:17.320
...and showing the path to us.
michi wo shimesunda

00:23:17.320 --> 00:23:21.560
So please, keep on holding my hand...
Dakara kono te zutto

00:23:21.560 --> 00:23:24.530
...and never let it go...
hanasanaide

00:23:26.030 --> 00:23:27.000
ONI [ONl]

00:23:27.000 --> 00:23:28.540
ONI [ONl]
So, in the end, what is an oni?

00:23:28.540 --> 00:23:28.640
ONI [ONl]

00:23:28.640 --> 00:23:29.570
ONI [ONl]
A god!

00:23:29.570 --> 00:23:30.300
ONI [ONl]
Oh? Really?

00:23:30.300 --> 00:23:30.560
Oh? Really?

00:23:30.640 --> 00:23:32.210
The mountains, the skies, the rivers...

00:23:32.210 --> 00:23:34.110
They're all gods. It's the same thing.

00:23:34.210 --> 00:23:35.470
They are?

00:23:35.540 --> 00:23:36.340
They are.

00:23:36.340 --> 00:23:38.680
Prof. Miwa has something else to say, right?

